{"4464510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Board Forge", "steam_appid": 4464510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board Forge is a digital board game creator and multiplayer experience. Design your own game boards from scratch — choose your grid size, place tiles with unique effects like question challenges, move bonuses, and player swaps, then save and share your creations. Play locally with friends or jump into online matches through Steam, competing on boards built by players around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice, answer trivia questions, and race to the finish line. Every board tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full board creation suite with customisable tile effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for up to 6 players on the same machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer via Steam with lobby browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trivia question tiles with true/false and multiple choice formats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character pieces to represent each player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in tutorial to get new players creating boards in minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save, load, and edit your boards any time</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board Forge is a digital board game creator and multiplayer experience. Design your own game boards from scratch — choose your grid size, place tiles with unique effects like question challenges, move bonuses, and player swaps, then save and share your creations. Play locally with friends or jump into online matches through Steam, competing on boards built by players around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice, answer trivia questions, and race to the finish line. Every board tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full board creation suite with customisable tile effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for up to 6 players on the same machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer via Steam with lobby browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trivia question tiles with true/false and multiple choice formats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character pieces to represent each player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in tutorial to get new players creating boards in minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save, load, and edit your boards any time</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Board Forge is a creative board game experience where you design, build, and play your own custom game boards. Place trivia questions, movement traps, and player swap tiles, then challenge friends in local or online multiplayer matches through Steam.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464510/6dee2241b53994adee59f4280929e91bc3917a28/header.jpg?t=1777902369", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464510/ece666fa19f59bb764fd2e49a5b3f2a6d3931af0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777902369", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464510/ece666fa19f59bb764fd2e49a5b3f2a6d3931af0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777902369", "website": "https://eggsplatstudio.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\